      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also as an addendum: \nI've seen other posts that suggest reintroducing this feature (or something similar) is in planning. If that's the case, then great! I'm just a little ignorant on these topics :) but that's fine. Anyone who can mark this post as closed, I encourage you to do so! \nThe whole point of my post, after all, is to [hopefully] bring just a little bit of the demand for the resurrection of our resize tools to light so if that's not needed, I'm all the happier! :D",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
